        "snippet": "5. How can we increase platelets in dengue? To increase platelet count during dengue it is important to consume foods that are rich in nutrients such as vitamin C, iron and folate. Some foods that can help increase platelets include papaya leaf juice, coconut water, kiwi, pumpkin, spinach and beetroot. It is also important to stay hydrated by drinking plenty of fluids such as water, coconut water and herbal teas. However it is important to note that medical treatment may be necessary in severe cases of dengue fever.",
